notes.content:
Becrowned demo version will participate in Steam Next Fest which starts tomorrow and will run until October 22. 

Also, a new 1.2 update for the demo version is ready and available for download, which includes a lot of fixes and general improvements. 

I would be very happy if you play the demo version during the festival. It will help a lot to make the game known to as many people as possible. 

Full list of changes in the new update: 
[list]
[i][*] Reworked the system of interaction between the player and the environment, now there should be no errors in interaction;
[*] Removed possible softlock when interacting with valves in the basement;
[*] Monsters on the walls have a larger damage radius and less damage;
[*] Fixed a bug where you could use syringes when the boss walked away from the TV set;
[*] Fixed minor save/load errors;
[*] Added flashlight on/off to the controller key R3(RS) or F on the keyboard;
[*] Added weapon reloading to the R key on the keyboard and Circle\B on the controller;
[*] Changed inventory indexing, removed empty slot;
[*] General UI/UX improvements;
[*] Improved game sound system;
[*] Multiple small improvements and bug fixes. [/i]
[/list]

Thank you all for your support and feedback.

With Love, 
Ernest.

Hello friends! 

The first big update of the demo version is ready and available for download.
Most importantly, we have completely redesigned the cameras for the demo.


Thank you for playing the demo and also for your valuable feedback. 
I read every message and we will try to handle your feedback as much as possible. 
Thank you. 


Full change log:
[list]
[*] Big cameras update, playing should become much more comfortable on both control schemes;
[*] Studio logo is played only for the first time when entering the game;
[*] Game pauses when you pick up notes;
[*] Game pauses when you pick up items;
[*] Added tracers when firing a gun to make it clear the direction of shots;
[*] Added a display showing the number of bullets in the weapon;
[*] Balance of movement speed and stamina;
[*] Fixed bugs in radio sounds;
[*] Fixed bug with small text of notes in Japanese localization;
[*] Visual fixes and improvements to locations;
[*] General localization fixes;
[*] Fixed softlocks when interacting with the map (if you press map and pause at the same time);
[*] Fixed control switching when exiting to the main menu;
[*] Triggers and colliders size fixes.
[/list]

With Love, 
Ernest
